1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,789
Days fifteen to twenty eight, the secretory phase.

2
00:00:03,789 --> 00:00:10,950
The empty follicle becomes the yellow corpus luteum, whose progesterone makes the lining thick and ready.

3
00:00:10,950 --> 00:00:18,710
If no embryo arrives, the corpus luteum dies, progesterone falls, and the cycle starts again.

